<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - April 24.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - April 24.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    92/95     99/102     UNQ     190/196</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   98/100   104/106   195/198   213/216</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes on Thursday hovered around their previous day levels, traders said. They said demand dipped slightly from earlier this week, and some suppliers lowered quotes slightly to attract shipowners. However, tight supplies and firm prices in South Korea supported sentiment, they said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
